{"title":"Career roadmap · Logistics Coordinator","role":"Logistics Coordinator","summary":"A Logistics Coordinator coordinates the movement of goods, materials and shipments across suppliers, warehouses, transporters, ports, customers and other stakeholders. The role involves shipment planning, documentation, inventory coordination, transport tracking, customs awareness, vendor communication and logistics data analysis.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"B.Com","Course":"Foreign Trade / International Business","Timeline assumption":"3- or 4-year B.Com pathway depending on the university. If the programme follows a four-year honours/research structure, use the additional year for advanced supply-chain analytics, international logistics and a substantial industry internship."},"about":[{"label":"Primary skills","text":"Logistics operations, trade documentation, Excel, inventory, shipment tracking, communication"},{"label":"Additional skills","text":"ERP, Power BI, SQL, supply-chain analytics, customs procedures and digital logistics platforms"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Logistics Intern, Import-Export Intern, Shipping Documentation Intern, Supply Chain Intern"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Logistics Coordinator, Logistics Executive, Export Executive, Import Executive, Supply Chain Executive"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Logistics Coordinator, Logistics Analyst, Transport Planner, Supply Chain Specialist"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Logistics Manager, Supply Chain Manager, International Logistics Manager, Operations Manager"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com Foreign Trade / International Business graduate, this is a strong and direct career alignment, particularly for international logistics, freight forwarding, import-export operations, supply-chain coordination and trade documentation."},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Foreign Trade / International Business","Logistics / Import-Export Internship","Logistics Executive / Operations Coordinator","Logistics Coordinator","Senior Logistics Coordinator","Logistics Manager / Supply Chain Manager"],"label":"Career route"}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Trade + logistics fundamentals"},{"text":"University curriculum + NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Map an end-to-end shipment process"},{"text":"Domain knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Excel + business communication"},{"text":"Microsoft Excel","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/excel"},{"text":"Shipment/inventory tracker"},{"text":"Digital + execution"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Import-export documentation"},{"text":"DGFT + customs resources"},{"text":"Prepare a mock export documentation set"},{"text":"Trade readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Inventory + transportation management"},{"text":"NPTEL + supply-chain resources"},{"text":"Logistics planning case"},{"text":"Operations"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"ERP + supply-chain analytics"},{"text":"ERP/analytics resources"},{"text":"Shipment KPI dashboard"},{"text":"Technology"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Logistics internship"},{"text":"Logistics company/freight forwarder"},{"text":"Internship + process-improvement report"},{"text":"Industry readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"International logistics + analytics"},{"text":"Trade/logistics resources"},{"text":"End-to-end import/export project"},{"text":"Specialisation"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Job preparation + professional certification"},{"text":"Industry resources"},{"text":"Logistics portfolio + applications"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core logistics stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Logistics fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Freight forwarding"},{"text":"Order fulfilment"},{"text":"Shipment planning"},{"text":"Delivery scheduling"},{"text":"Reverse logistics"},{"text":"Last-mile logistics"},{"text":"Third-party logistics (3PL)"},{"text":"Fourth-party logistics (4PL)"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the complete flow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier","Procurement","Warehouse","Transport","Port/Airport","Customs","Destination","Customer"]}]},{"heading":"International trade","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this degree, international trade should be a major strength."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Import procedures"},{"text":"Export procedures"},{"text":"Trade documentation"},{"text":"International payments"},{"text":"Foreign exchange basics"},{"text":"Trade finance"},{"text":"Customs procedures"},{"text":"Freight forwarding"},{"text":"Shipping modes"},{"text":"International transportation"},{"text":"Trade compliance"},{"text":"Country-specific requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Commercial invoice"},{"text":"Packing list"},{"text":"Bill of lading"},{"text":"Air waybill"},{"text":"Certificate of origin"},{"text":"Insurance certificate"},{"text":"Shipping bill"},{"text":"Bill of entry"},{"text":"Purchase order"},{"text":"Letter of credit"},{"text":"Proforma invoice"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Always verify current statutory documentation requirements with the relevant authorities or employer before executing a real shipment."}]},{"heading":"Incoterms","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Incoterms are essential for international logistics."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EXW"},{"text":"FCA"},{"text":"FOB"},{"text":"CFR"},{"text":"CIF"},{"text":"CPT"},{"text":"CIP"},{"text":"DAP"},{"text":"DPU"},{"text":"DDP"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand:"},{"type":"p","text":"Who bears the cost?\nWho bears the risk?\nWho arranges transportation?\nWho handles customs?\nWhere does responsibility transfer?"},{"type":"p","text":"Use the current official Incoterms rules from the International Chamber of Commerce when working on real transactions."},{"type":"p","text":"International Chamber of Commerce","url":"https://iccwbo.org/"}]},{"heading":"Transportation management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Road"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Full truckload"},{"text":"Less-than-truckload"},{"text":"Route planning"},{"text":"Fleet coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Rail"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Freight movement"},{"text":"Intermodal transportation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Air"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air cargo"},{"text":"Air waybill"},{"text":"Freight calculation"},{"text":"Airport handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ocean"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Containerisation"},{"text":"FCL"},{"text":"LCL"},{"text":"Bill of lading"},{"text":"Ports"},{"text":"Vessel schedules"},{"text":"Demurrage and detention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Multimodal"},{"type":"flow","items":["Understand how road","rail","sea","air can be combined into one supply chain."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Warehouse management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Receiving"},{"text":"Put-away"},{"text":"Picking"},{"text":"Packing"},{"text":"Dispatch"},{"text":"Stock counting"},{"text":"Cycle counting"},{"text":"Inventory reconciliation"},{"text":"Warehouse layout"},{"text":"SKU management"},{"text":"Barcode/RFID concepts"},{"text":"FIFO"},{"text":"FEFO where applicable"},{"text":"Warehouse KPIs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important metrics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Order accuracy"},{"text":"Pick accuracy"},{"text":"Order cycle time"},{"text":"Warehouse utilisation"},{"text":"On-time dispatch"},{"text":"Stock-out rate"},{"text":"Damage rate"}]}]},{"heading":"Inventory management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Safety stock"},{"text":"Reorder point"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Economic order quantity"},{"text":"ABC analysis"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Service levels"},{"text":"Stock ageing"},{"text":"Slow-moving inventory"},{"text":"Dead stock"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relationship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Demand","Inventory","Procurement","Warehouse","Transportation","Customer"]}]},{"heading":"Customs and trade compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a working understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customs declarations"},{"text":"Import/export documentation"},{"text":"HS classification"},{"text":"Customs valuation"},{"text":"Duties and taxes"},{"text":"Restricted/prohibited goods"},{"text":"Trade licences"},{"text":"Compliance checks"},{"text":"Export controls"},{"text":"Documentation accuracy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For India, become familiar with the Directorate General of Foreign Trade (DGFT) and Indian customs ecosystem."},{"type":"p","text":"DGFT · Indian Customs / CBIC","url":"https://www.dgft.gov.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Regulations change frequently, so real-world shipments must always follow current official requirements."}]},{"heading":"Logistics technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Shipment trackers"},{"text":"Inventory trackers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business intelligence"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"KPI monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Microsoft Power BI","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/power-platform/products/power-bi"},{"type":"h","text":"ERP"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand concepts around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP"},{"text":"Oracle"},{"text":"Microsoft Dynamics"},{"text":"Warehouse Management Systems"},{"text":"Transportation Management Systems"},{"text":"Order Management Systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to master every ERP platform. Understand the business process and data flow."},{"type":"h","text":"Logistics KPI knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong coordinator should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Delivery"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"On-time delivery"},{"text":"On-time-in-full (OTIF)"},{"text":"Delivery lead time"},{"text":"Order cycle time"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Transportation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Freight cost"},{"text":"Cost per shipment"},{"text":"Cost per kilometre"},{"text":"Vehicle utilisation"},{"text":"Load utilisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Warehouse"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inventory accuracy"},{"text":"Picking accuracy"},{"text":"Order processing time"},{"text":"Warehouse utilisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Order fulfilment rate"},{"text":"Return rate"},{"text":"Damage rate"},{"text":"Customer complaints"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International logistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customs clearance time"},{"text":"Port dwell time"},{"text":"Demurrage"},{"text":"Detention"},{"text":"Freight cost"},{"text":"Documentation error rate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Projects to build during B.Com"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — International shipment tracker"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an Excel tracker containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shipment ID"},{"text":"Supplier"},{"text":"Customer"},{"text":"Origin"},{"text":"Destination"},{"text":"Carrier"},{"text":"Mode"},{"text":"Container number"},{"text":"ETD"},{"text":"ETA"},{"text":"Current status"},{"text":"Customs status"},{"text":"Expected delivery"},{"text":"Delay reason"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create an automated dashboard showing delayed and at-risk shipments."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Import-export documentation project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a fictional shipment and prepare a document workflow covering:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Purchase Order","Commercial Invoice","Packing List","Transport Document","Customs Documentation","Delivery"]},{"type":"p","text":"Use fictional data only."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Warehouse inventory dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU"},{"text":"Opening stock"},{"text":"Purchases"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Closing stock"},{"text":"Reorder level"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Stock ageing"},{"text":"Stock-out risk"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build the dashboard in Excel or Power BI."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Route optimisation case"},{"type":"p","text":"Use a fictional dataset containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer locations"},{"text":"Vehicle capacity"},{"text":"Distance"},{"text":"Delivery windows"},{"text":"Fuel cost"},{"text":"Delivery priority"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create a basic transportation plan."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Logistics cost analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Freight"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Handling"},{"text":"Customs"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Last-mile delivery"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Calculate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Total logistics cost per shipment/order/unit"},{"type":"p","text":"Then identify cost-reduction opportunities."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Supply-chain disruption analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Study a hypothetical disruption such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Port congestion"},{"text":"Fuel-price increase"},{"text":"Supplier delay"},{"text":"Container shortage"},{"text":"Extreme weather"},{"text":"Geopolitical disruption"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Risk","Impact","Alternative","Cost","Recovery plan"]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"International Logistics"},{"text":"Trade + freight + customs"},{"text":"DGFT + ICC"},{"text":"International Logistics Manager"}],[{"text":"Import/Export Operations"},{"text":"Documentation + compliance + shipping"},{"text":"DGFT + customs"},{"text":"Export/Import Manager"}],[{"text":"Freight Forwarding"},{"text":"Ocean/air/road freight + documentation"},{"text":"Industry training"},{"text":"Freight Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"Warehouse Management"},{"text":"Inventory + WMS + operations"},{"text":"Supply-chain resources"},{"text":"Warehouse Manager"}],[{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Fleet + routes + TMS"},{"text":"Logistics resources"},{"text":"Transport Manager"}],[{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + Power BI + statistics"},{"text":"NPTEL + Microsoft"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Sourcing + negotiation + supplier management"},{"text":"Supply-chain resources"},{"text":"Procurement Manager"}],[{"text":"Trade Compliance"},{"text":"Customs + regulations + documentation"},{"text":"DGFT + customs"},{"text":"Trade Compliance Manager"}],[{"text":"Cold Chain"},{"text":"Temperature-controlled logistics + quality"},{"text":"Industry resources"},{"text":"Cold Chain Manager"}],[{"text":"E-commerce Logistics"},{"text":"Fulfilment + last-mile + analytics"},{"text":"Industry resources"},{"text":"E-commerce Logistics Manager"}],[{"text":"Project Cargo"},{"text":"Heavy/oversized cargo + planning"},{"text":"Industry training"},{"text":"Project Logistics Manager"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Logistics coordination is increasingly becoming a technology-enabled planning role."},{"type":"p","text":"Routine shipment tracking will increasingly be automated. The valuable professional will be able to interpret data, manage exceptions, coordinate stakeholders and optimise logistics networks."},{"type":"p","text":"Build toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-powered logistics planning"},{"text":"Predictive ETA"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Route optimisation"},{"text":"Digital freight platforms"},{"text":"IoT tracking"},{"text":"Warehouse automation"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"Supply-chain control towers"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Sustainability analytics"},{"text":"Carbon accounting"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Global trade analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Logistics expertise","international trade","analytics","ERP","AI","communication"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / public-sector / research exposure"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / ecosystem","Useful exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"DGFT"},{"text":"Foreign trade policy, export/import procedures and trade documentation"}],[{"text":"Indian Customs / CBIC ecosystem"},{"text":"Customs procedures and clearance concepts"}],[{"text":"Indian Ports / port authorities"},{"text":"Cargo handling and maritime logistics"}],[{"text":"Airports / cargo terminals"},{"text":"Air-cargo operations"}],[{"text":"CONCOR"},{"text":"Rail-based container logistics"}],[{"text":"India Post"},{"text":"Parcel, distribution and logistics operations"}],[{"text":"Public-sector logistics/transport organisations"},{"text":"Transportation and supply-chain operations"}],[{"text":"University/IIT/IIM research groups"},{"text":"Supply-chain optimisation and logistics analytics"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"DGFT · CBIC · CONCOR · India Post","url":"https://www.dgft.gov.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Actual internship openings vary b